{"id": 2441, "title": "Gold Egg", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "gold-egg", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/2441_gold-egg.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["一天早上，一个农民发现自己的鸡生了一个金蛋。他非常高兴地把蛋带回家。从那以后，他每天早上都能得到一个金蛋，所以，他的钱变得越来越多。但是这个农民也变得越来越贪心，他觉得每天一个金蛋太慢了，他想得到鸡肚子里所有的金蛋，就把鸡杀死了。但是，鸡肚子里什么也没有，他又变成了穷人。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["一天早上，一個農民發現自己的雞生了一個金蛋。他非常高興地把蛋帶回家。從那以後，他每天早上都能得到一個金蛋，所以，他的錢變得越來越多。但是這個農民也變得越來越貪心，他覺得每天一個金蛋太慢了，他想得到雞肚子裡所有的金蛋，就把雞殺死了。但是，雞肚子裡什麼也沒有，他又變成了窮人。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["yī tiān zǎo shang， yī gè nóng mín fā xiàn zì jǐ de jī shēng le yī gè jīn dàn。 tā fēi cháng gāo xìng de bǎ dàn dài huí jiā。 cóng nà yǐ hòu， tā měi tiān zǎo shang dōu néng dé dào yī gè jīn dàn， suǒ yǐ， tā de qián biàn de yuè lái yuè duō。 dàn shì zhè gè nóng mín yě biàn de yuè lái yuè tān xīn， tā jué de měi tiān yī gè jīn dàn tài màn le， tā xiǎng dé dào jī dù zi lǐ suǒ yǒu de jīn dàn， jiù bǎ jī shā sǐ le。 dàn shì， jī dù zi lǐ shén me yě méi yǒu， tā yòu biàn chéng le qióng rén。"], "english_paragraphs": ["One morning, a farmer discovered that his hen had laid a golden egg. Delighted, he took the egg home. From then on, he found a golden egg every morning, and he grew richer and richer. But the farmer also grew greedier and greedier. He thought one golden egg a day was too slow, so he killed the hen to get all the golden eggs he imagined were inside her. But there was nothing inside, and he became poor again."], "english_full": "One morning, a farmer discovered that his hen had laid a golden egg. Delighted, he took the egg home. From then on, he found a golden egg every morning, and he grew richer and richer. But the farmer also grew greedier and greedier. He thought one golden egg a day was too slow, so he killed the hen to get all the golden eggs he imagined were inside her. But there was nothing inside, and he became poor again.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\"